# calib: its slider (x 500, the track y 40 to 408, gamma 5 at the top, 1 at the foot) sets the gamma of the striped box's mutable color;
# a click high on the track (gamma near 3.8), a drag toward its foot (near 1.5), then q quits (quitsensor)
move 250 200
wait
click 1 500 150
wait
drag 1 500 150 500 360
wait
key q
